Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:20.31,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\pos(223.508,454.067)}Brought to you by: Orange-Flash | Bit.ly/2HKzs60
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:20.31,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\pos(487.792,424.4)}Original air date: 1984.08.10
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you laying idle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asked to run an errand, but I came quickly to play with Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any homework to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, why don't you do it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather do it after playing with Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you really have any time after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have after playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I remember! I want to watch Perman anime, today @6 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After watching TV, it's dinner-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum said today she will make steak for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after dinner, it's bath-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Going to bathroom, changing clothes it will be about 9PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's sleep-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish mum returns ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! What a waste of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to spend the time meaningfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's Time Bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It enables one to manipulate the spare time however one wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow-down or speed-up the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mum said she'll be back by 3:00 PM. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's 2:30 PM, so I'm going deposit the remaining 30 minutes into Time Bank. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressing this button will save 30 minutes into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Save 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the transaction. I've took care of your 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now 30 minutes have passed. Look at your clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,True, it's now become 3:00 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you leave it like this, homework time
